@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Services";
}

<section class="services-page" aria-label="Services">
    <div class="landing-container">
        <div class="services-hero">
            <p class="services-kicker">Services</p>
            <h1 class="services-title">Custom software strategy and delivery for operators who need systems that fit reality.</h1>
            <p class="services-lede">
                I work with founders, small teams, and specialized businesses that have outgrown generic tools.
                If your workflow is too specific for off-the-shelf software, we design and build systems around how your business actually operates.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="services-grid">
            <article class="service-card">
                <h2>Discovery and architecture</h2>
                <p>
                    Clarify the real problem, map current operations, and define the right technical path before development starts.
                    This includes system design, delivery sequencing, integration planning, and risk reduction from day one.
                </p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card">
                <h2>Custom application development</h2>
                <p>
                    Build web platforms, internal tools, dashboards, and data-driven workflows with clear ownership from concept to production.
                    Every build is designed for reliability, maintainability, and fit-for-purpose user experience.
                </p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card">
                <h2>AI and workflow integration</h2>
                <p>
                    Integrate AI where it creates real leverage: document analysis, assisted content generation, decision support, and workflow automation.
                    The goal is measurable operational improvement, not novelty features.
                </p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card">
                <h2>Product hardening and modernization</h2>
                <p>
                    Improve performance, reduce technical debt, and increase deployment confidence in existing systems.
                    Includes refactoring strategy, architecture cleanup, and production-readiness upgrades.
                </p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card">
                <h2>What we can build</h2>
                <p>
                    Custom CRM and client pipelines, project tracking systems, quoting and proposal tools, operations dashboards,
                    and internal portals that connect your team, data, and process into one practical workflow.
                </p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card">
                <h2>Industry-specific tools</h2>
                <p>
                    Domain tools for teams with specialized workflows, including design and planning software for architecture or landscaping firms,
                    asset and deliverable tracking tools for creative studios, and compliance-aware reporting flows for technical teams.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>

        <div class="services-cta">
            <h2>Need a focused build partner?</h2>
            <p>
                Tell me what you are trying to ship and what constraints you are facing.
                We can scope a practical first phase that produces visible value fast.
            </p>
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="mailto:idiehl@atlasuniversalis.onmicrosoft.com">Start the conversation</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
